UserArena Non-Commercial Research License and Data Use Agreement

1. Scope

These terms apply to the original UserArena code, documentation, and dataset
materials made available in this repository, including de-identified interaction
records, product metadata, and reconstructed interface images (the "Materials").
Third-party materials and dependencies remain subject to their respective
licenses and rights; these terms do not replace those licenses or grant rights
