2. Permitted use

Subject to these terms, you may access, use, copy, and modify the Materials
solely for non-commercial research. Retain this notice and agreement with any
permitted copies. Commercial use requires prior written authorization from the
applicable rights holders.

3. Data use restrictions

Consistent with the paper's Ethics and Data Statement, you must not:

(a) attempt to re-identify users represented in the Materials;
(b) link the Materials with external personal data; or
(c) redistribute the Materials without prior authorization from the applicable
    rights holders.

Access to this repository does not authorize redistribution, sublicensing, or
sale of the Materials. Any separately supplied data use agreement and access
conditions must also be followed; this license does not waive them.

